tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/523193119b4b0b6472e62110208a7043.mp4?t=1783615917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off against dreadful stalkers—twisted creations born from sinister experiments. These relentless creatures possess unique abilities, making them formidable foes who will stop at nothing to hunt you down.</p>", "short_description": "A third-person survival horror game that you play as a girl with psychic power who tries to escape from a secret lab and is pursued by deadly stalkers.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/060414b47728c39460a003776ad33dbceb01b3fc/header.jpg?t=1783615917", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/3456c48a7a9ed7f8e295d4195841d900198ceab7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783615917", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/3456c48a7a9ed7f8e295d4195841d900198ceab7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783615917", "website": "https://www.mooncatalyst.com/psychodeadgame", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS 10 (64-BIT Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8600 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 1070 Ti, AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD (Preferred), HDD (Supported). Framerate might drop in graphics-intensive scenes.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor an